Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.40,0:00:07.17,Opening,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,0)}The radiance of the night shines through my window
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.17,0:00:11.12,Opening,,0,0,0,,but the path to immortality is long.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.60,0:00:15.85,Opening,,0,0,0,,The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.85,0:00:21.01,Opening,,0,0,0,,Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.28,0:00:25.00,Opening,,0,0,0,,Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.40,0:00:28.25,Opening,,0,0,0,,I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.25,0:00:33.52,Opening,,0,0,0,,The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.72,0:00:37.48,Opening,,0,0,0,,I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.84,0:00:40.48,Opening,,0,0,0,,as the storm rages just below.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.88,0:00:44.85,Opening,,0,0,0,,I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.85,0:00:47.84,Opening,,0,0,0,,I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.00,0:00:50.69,Opening,,0,0,0,,why the world is a-changing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.71,0:00:54.04,Opening,,0,0,0,,Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.28,0:00:57.21,Opening,,0,0,0,,Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.21,0:01:00.29,Opening,,0,0,0,,experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.45,0:01:03.17,Opening,,0,0,0,,I will defy the light in the sky
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.17,0:01:06.61,Opening,,0,0,0,,to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.69,0:01:19.05,Opening,,0,0,0,,Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.21,0:01:22.13,Opening,,0,0,0,,Transform your insignificant body into light.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.29,0:01:25.25,Opening,,0,0,0,,The hardships of the journey
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.37,0:01:28.21,Opening,,0,0,0,,will temper this young man's heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.21,0:01:32.85,Opening,,0,0,0,,If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.60,0:01:43.48,Opening,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,690)\fad(1000,1000)}Renegade Immortal\NSubtitles by Bonobosubs\Nhttps://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.44,0:01:50.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,1000)\pos(960,503)}10 years ago
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.40,0:01:51.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,Stop running !
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.20,0:01:52.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,Stop him !
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.80,0:01:53.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,Stay where you are !
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.64,0:01:55.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,Hand over the bell and I'll spare your life !
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.76,0:01:56.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,Stop !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.88,0:02:04.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'll handle this.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.04,0:02:10.60,Card Hard,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1375,479)\fad(300,300)}Zhao Guo\NRogue cultivator\N10th layer of Qi Condensation
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.96,0:02:11.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,Young Master Teng, this is my family heirloom,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.32,0:02:12.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,it's useless to you !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.60,0:02:15.00,Card Hard,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1368,452)\fad(300,300)}Teng Li\N14th layer of Qi Condensation
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.96,0:02:15.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,Even if it's useless,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.60,0:02:17.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,I still I want it !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.88,0:02:20.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,Hand it over ! Now !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.32,0:02:21.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,Hurry !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.64,0:02:23.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,Are the lives of low level cultivators like me
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.68,0:02:25.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,worthless to you !?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.24,0:02:27.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,Give it !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.24,0:02:58.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,Li'er greets Grandfather.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.48,0:03:03.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,My dear grandson,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.16,0:03:06.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,you're the heir of the Teng Family.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.24,0:03:09.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,You can take whatever you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.88,0:03:13.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,All the treasures under this sky are yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.32,0:03:28.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with this place ?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.52,0:03:30.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,My Divine Sense is locked at 300 meters...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.96,0:03:44.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,After I flatten this place,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.00,0:03:46.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,you won't have anywhere to hide !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.36,0:04:02.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,What the hell !?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.48,0:04:06.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,You won't trap me !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.12,0:04:24.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,Scram !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.92,0:04:27.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now's the time !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.48,0:04:51.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,You dared to ambush me...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.48,0:04:56.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,Damn it !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.76,0:04:58.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,When I catch you,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.84,0:05:00.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'll make you suffer !
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.32,0:05:02.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'll extract your soul
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.40,0:05:05.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,and I will refine it until you die !
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.80,0:05:06.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,Senior !
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.40,0:05:09.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,Relax, I'm not dead yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.16,0:05:13.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,This brat is a hundred times more talented than you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.36,0:05:15.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,He never had to struggle
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.36,0:05:16.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,and was fed with a silver spoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.04,0:05:18.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,Without that artifact he had,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.92,0:05:20.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,he'd be dead already.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.08,0:05:24.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,I had to destroy that artifact he had in order to kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.28,0:05:25.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's okay,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.12,0:05:26.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,we're just getting started.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.88,0:05:50.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,Little Lin, what are you looking for ?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.12,0:05:53.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,Found it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.52,0:05:57.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,There you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.92,0:06:03.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,Why did you stop running ?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.20,0:06:32.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,You have nowhere to escape to !
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.24,0:06:44.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,Senior, help me !
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.84,0:07:12.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,What is this stench ?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.28,0:07:18.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,Another one of his schemes !
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.52,0:07:22.32,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1645,413)\fad(300,000)}Wu Yu's Corpse
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.28,0:07:24.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,A Green Core ?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.56,0:07:27.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,I never thought someone would cultivate the Green Core Method.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.12,0:07:30.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is nothing like a Golden Core.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.96,0:07:31.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's an explosive
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.00,0:07:33.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,with devastating power.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.48,0:07:35.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,Luckily, we're far enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.20,0:08:04.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,This looks like a semi-sentient Corpse Puppet.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.76,0:08:07.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,How did you know it was here ?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.44,0:08:12.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,I sensed that all the spiritual energy
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.48,0:08:13.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,was converging towards here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.64,0:08:15.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,But strangely,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.36,0:08:17.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,the closer we got,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.56,0:08:19.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,the sparser the Blue Thread Vines.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.60,0:08:21.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.16,0:08:23.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,I guessed that this place hides
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.68,0:08:25.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,something even the vines fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.68,0:08:30.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,That brat is probably just fleeing now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.60,0:08:31.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,Since he gave up chasing you,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.84,0:08:33.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,it's time to counterattack.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.72,0:08:48.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,Trying to run ?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.88,0:08:49.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,I won't let you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.56,0:09:00.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,Your lowly life
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.08,0:09:02.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,isn't worth enough to die together !
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.08,0:09:05.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,He's gambling
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.92,0:09:07.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,on whose sword is faster.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.16,0:09:09.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,I can still teleport you, don't risk it !
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.16,0:09:14.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,Teng Li will die today !
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.64,0:09:26.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,Madman !
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.20,0:09:27.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,You're insane !
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.64,0:09:28.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,Die !
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.44,0:09:34.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,Senior !
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.16,0:09:52.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,Note: A bag of holding is basically a transportable compressed space used for storage.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.48,0:10:36.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,Kid, you were reckless.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.08,0:10:38.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,Had I been slower,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.24,0:10:39.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,you'd be dead !
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.56,0:10:44.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,This was my only chance to kill Teng Li.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.12,0:10:46.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,If I had missed it
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.68,0:10:47.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,and allowed him to recover,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.28,0:10:49.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,it would've been over.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.16,0:10:51.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,But that gamble was too risky !
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.16,0:10:53.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,It wasn't a gamble.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.00,0:10:55.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,He was exhausted
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.96,0:10:57.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,and couldn't outspeed my sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.96,0:11:01.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wang Lin,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.16,0:11:03.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,I feel like I met a new you today.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.92,0:11:06.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,Even I might not have dared
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.12,0:11:07.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,to gamble like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.92,0:11:13.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,Will it work if I use Foundation Stealing on him ?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.24,0:11:15.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,Perfectly.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.20,0:11:19.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,He reached Late stage Foundation Establishment at such a young age
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.64,0:11:21.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,and his talent is exceptional.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.32,0:11:23.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,Senior, please guard me while I use your method.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.92,0:12:12.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,If you kill me,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.32,0:12:14.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,my grandfather will hunt you !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.60,0:12:22.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,Grandfather, save me !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.24,0:12:32.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,Li'er !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.96,0:12:53.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,Who is it ?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.32,0:12:55.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,Stop !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.96,0:12:58.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,If you spare my grandson's soul
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.48,0:13:01.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,I promise to spare you !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.04,0:13:03.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,He killed my friend
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.68,0:13:04.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,and tried to kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.32,0:13:06.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,He's evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.58,0:13:08.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,He isn't dying meaninglessly,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.16,0:13:10.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,but helping my cultivation.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.48,0:13:18.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,If you dare to kill my grandson
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.84,0:13:20.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,and scatter his soul,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.04,0:13:23.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,even if I need to search the whole planet,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.48,0:13:26.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,I, Teng Huayuan, will take your life !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.32,0:13:43.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,Li'er !!!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.12,0:13:57.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ancestor...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.88,0:14:00.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,don't waste your Nascent Soul's Soul Blood !
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.76,0:14:02.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,I swear that
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.72,0:14:04.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will search heaven and earth
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.36,0:14:08.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,and I will avenge you !
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.92,0:14:13.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,Curse,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.60,0:14:15.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,go !
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.32,0:14:20.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,Curse,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.64,0:14:21.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,activate !
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.28,0:14:30.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,Whoever kills a Teng
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.00,0:14:34.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,shall suffer Teng Huayuan's curse !
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.28,0:15:04.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,A Nascent Soul cultivator cursed you at great cost.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.76,0:15:06.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,If you get too close to him
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.96,0:15:08.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,he will teleport to you instantly.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.08,0:15:09.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,Senior,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.40,0:15:11.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,is there any way to break this curse ?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.76,0:15:13.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,Don't panic.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.84,0:15:15.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,Just keep your distance.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.68,0:15:16.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,Since I'm with you,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.76,0:15:18.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,he will never be able to find you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.12,0:16:19.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.76,0:16:20.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,to continue to cultivate
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.52,0:16:24.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,you need to find an extreme Yin energy gathering spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.84,0:16:28.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,Cultivate the Underworld Ascension Method I taught you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.36,0:16:30.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.16,0:16:31.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,Senior !
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.49,0:18:41.65,Note,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,1000)}Teng Huayuan had a jade that cracked when Teng Li died. It's very common for sects or families to have objects that represent the life of a disciple. The disciple will leave a part of his Divine Sense inside it so that when he dies, the Divine Sense will vanish to inform of his death. Most of the time it will be a jade slip or a lamp.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.32,0:16:50.96,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,700)}I've been walking this path for endless years
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.97,0:16:50.96,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,700)}just to catch a glimpse of your silhouette.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.60,0:16:56.56,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,700)}Is it the compass of fate
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.44,0:16:56.56,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,700)}that wrote this outcome for us ?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.72,0:17:02.48,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,700)}The heavens want to erase your existence,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.60,0:17:08.20,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,700)}that's the obsession guiding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.48,0:17:13.80,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,700)}Is this the path to uncover
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.36,0:17:13.80,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,700)}truths from falsehoods ?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.08,0:17:19.40,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,700)}In a world of murk and shadow,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.98,0:17:19.40,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,700)}only the flame of truth can light the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.44,0:17:25.12,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,500)}Look at them all,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.32,0:17:25.12,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,500)}being carried by the waves.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.56,0:17:29.76,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,500)}Look at them all,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.72,0:17:29.76,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}being drowned.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.84,0:17:33.08,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,500)}I don't want to believe in whoever decides fate,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.12,0:17:36.16,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,300)}I will let the world refine my soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.29,0:17:41.72,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,500)}So what if I become an Immortal and defy the heavens ?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.98,0:17:41.72,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,500)}I will fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.72,0:17:44.84,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}I'll break through the abyss of despair
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.84,0:17:47.88,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}to finally learn who I really am.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.88,0:17:53.24,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,300)}My body is stained by the bloody color of slaughter,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.76,0:17:53.24,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,300)}I embrace this obsession.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.24,0:17:56.20,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,300)}I won't glance back at the wasteland I left behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.20,0:17:59.00,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,100)}Even if this suffering shatters my soul
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.00,0:18:04.48,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,700)}and I'm reborn countless times in hell,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.04,0:18:04.48,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,700)}I'll still fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.68,0:18:07.84,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}It's hard to avoid loneliness
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.84,0:18:10.88,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}when you are above everyone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.88,0:18:16.56,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}Can a moth that has witnessed the flames of a Suzaku
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.20,0:18:16.56,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}be afraid of a firefly ?
